flowchart TD
  A["Read the new side, the legacy rows,<br/>both outboxes and the dead-letter queues"] --> B{"Do an order's two sides differ?"}
  B -->|no| E["identical"]
  B -->|yes| C{"A message about it<br/>in a dead-letter queue?"}
  C -->|yes| D["DeadLettered<br/>fix the cause, then make redrive"]
  C -->|no| F{"Unpublished outbox row, unconfirmed command,<br/>or legacy version ahead of the new side's?"}
  F -->|yes| G["InFlight<br/>a change is on its way"]
  F -->|no| H["Unexplained on this read"]
  H --> I["Wait 2 s and read everything again"]
  I --> J{"Still unexplained?"}
  J -->|no| K["Cleared: named in a warning,<br/>not counted"]
  J -->|yes| L["Unexplained<br/>must be zero once the system has drained"]
